<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="b8f75b26">Open the retrospective by welcoming everyone and reiterating the purpose of the meeting. If a theme has been designated
share the selected topic for discussion with the participants. It is also good practice to encourage active participation
by asking a simple question to get discussion started and&amp;nbsp;open the meeting up to the participants. For example, ask
the group to describe their feelings about the last sprint in one or two words.</attribute>
