<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="a269ea33">Give each team member an opportunity to share their experiences and observations from the last sprint. Encourage the team
to identify specific pain points and key success factors, be sure to document these details. Make sure the team does not
progress to the next step until a common understanding has been reached about the sprint. Topics for discussion may include
roles, responsibilities, processes, practices, tools, communication channels, technology, etc.</attribute>
