<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="81743571"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="6841591">&lt;p&gt;
    Have the team select&amp;nbsp;one to three&amp;nbsp;topics from the previous step for which they can begin to generate
    solutions. Brainstorm solutions and changes&amp;nbsp;for the selected topics and&amp;nbsp;guide the team in&amp;nbsp;identifying
    specific, meaningful and realistic actions to improve the next sprint. Make sure the team agrees upon all actionable
    improvements to be made for the next sprint.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
