<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="a74f5525"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="1ac3e5e2">Close the meeting by thanking everyone for their time, effort and ideas. Recap the key takeaways, lessons learned and
action items that were discussed during the meeting. Revisit any action items agreed to for the next sprint to confirm
alignment and ownership of these items. Help the team understand how they will retain the results of the retrospective and
follow up on any actions. If applicable, document any actions from the retrospective as new Backlog Items to be considered
for prioritization during the next sprint planning meeting.</attribute>
